{
    "chapter_num": 10,
    "verses_count": 18,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Tola"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After Abimelech there arose to save Israel Tola the son of Puah, the son of Dodo, a man of Issachar; and he dwelt in Shamir in the mountains of Ephraim. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He judged Israel twenty-three years; and he died and was buried in Shamir."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jair"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After him arose Jair, a Gileadite; and he judged Israel twenty-two years. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now he had thirty sons who rode on thirty donkeys; they also had thirty towns, which are called "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Towns of Jair, Num. 32:41; Deut. 3:14"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Havoth Jair” to this day, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the land of Gilead. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jair died and was buried in Camon."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Israel Oppressed Again"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the children of Israel again did evil in the sight of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", and served the Baals and the Ashtoreths, the gods of Syria, the gods of Sidon, the gods of Moab, the gods of the people of Ammon, and the gods of the Philistines; and they forsook the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and did not serve Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the anger of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " was hot against Israel; and He sold them into the hands of the Philistines and into the hands of the people of Ammon. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "From that year they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. shattered"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "harassed and oppressed the children of Israel for eighteen years—all the children of Israel who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the other side of the Jordan in the land of the Amorites, in Gilead. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover the people of Ammon crossed over the Jordan to fight against Judah also, against Benjamin, and against the house of Ephraim, so that Israel was severely distressed."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the children of Israel cried out to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", saying, “We have sinned against You, because we have both forsaken our God and served the Baals!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to the children of Israel, “"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Did I"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "deliver you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from the Egyptians and from the Amorites and from the people of Ammon and from the Philistines? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also the Sidonians and Amalekites and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "LXX mss. Midianites"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Maonites oppressed you; and you cried out to Me, and I delivered you from their hand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yet you have forsaken Me and served other gods. Therefore I will deliver you no more. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Go and cry out to the gods which you have chosen; let them deliver you in your time of distress.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the children of Israel said to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", “We have sinned! Do to us whatever seems best to You; only deliver us this day, we pray.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they put away the foreign gods from among them and served the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". And His soul could no longer endure the misery of Israel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the people of Ammon gathered together and encamped in Gilead. And the children of Israel assembled together and encamped in Mizpah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the people, the leaders of Gilead, said to one another, “Who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the man who will begin the fight against the people of Ammon? He shall be head over all the inhabitants of Gilead.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}